  {
   "id": "barista-simulator-216630@1.2.0.0",
   "gameId": "barista-simulator-216630",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2.0.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-04T14:11:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Baristas!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Major Update for Barista Simulator Now Live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The update we've been working on for a long time is finally here! With this update, we're refreshing your coffee brewing experience and taking the game to the next level. Here's what awaits you:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch Notes 1.2.0.0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Custom Recipe System: You can now create your own custom recipes! Use different ingredients and cup sizes to craft unique coffee recipes. Blend your espresso, water, milk, and many other ingredients to create your signature coffee.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Café Menu Customization: With the new café menu system, you can add or remove coffee options from your menu. This feature allows you to easily manage prices and apply discounts or price increases.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Recipe Price Customization: Adjust coffee prices up or down by up to 25% based on the difficulty and ingredients used. Tailor the prices of unique items like frappes to fit your sales strategy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sticky Notes: By popular demand from baristas, you can now focus solely on coffee-making. With the new recipe pinning system, you can view complex recipes, like Shakerato, easily from the bottom right corner of the screen while preparing them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Enhanced AI Behavior: Baristas will no longer use machines you have restricted, creating a more organized workflow in your café.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Interface Enhancements: Improvements have been made to the menu system and user interface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved Lighting: Lighting has been enhanced for a better visual experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Machine and General Bug Fixes: Issues with machines and gameplay-affecting bugs have been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We continue to improve our game by taking your feedback into account. Now, it's time to dive back into your café and explore these new features!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy brewing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The CubeCube Sports LTD Team.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
