  {
   "id": "barista-simulator-216630@major-2023-05-20",
   "gameId": "barista-simulator-216630",
   "displayName": "Release Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-20T12:17:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear valued café owners,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are thrilled to announce that after an incredible journey of 1.5 years of development and 6 months in the early access stage, Barista Simulator is now ready for its highly anticipated 1.0 version release. As a small but passionate team of two, we have poured our hearts and souls into creating an immersive coffee shop simulation experience that meets the desires and expectations of our beloved players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Throughout this entire process, your feedback has been invaluable to us. We carefully listened to your suggestions and ideas, and we are proud to say that many of the features you desired have been incorporated into the game. Your voices have guided us, shaping the direction and evolution of Barista Simulator, and we cannot thank you enough for your unwavering support and valuable input.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With version 1.0, we mark the culmination of our efforts in the early access stage. However, this does not mean that the journey ends here. We remain committed to providing ongoing updates to enhance your coffee shop experience. Our development pipeline is bursting with exciting plans, including the introduction of new machines, customized recipes, ne café environments, and a plethora of decorative updates. Our dedication to making Barista Simulator the ultimate coffee brewing and serving adventure remains as strong as ever.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To ensure that you stay up-to-date on all the latest news and developments, we have established a dedicated Twitter account. Follow us on Twitter for regular updates, sneak peeks behind the scenes, and exclusive content. Your continued support and engagement mean the world to us, and we can't wait to share the next phase of this incredible journey with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, thank you for being an integral part of the Barista Simulator community. Together, we have created something truly special.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Warm regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dev Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our Community Links",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
